# contact_guard refuses XY while a touch made by FORCE_MOVE is held
# (KAN-828).  Exits with an error.  FORCE_MOVE uses its own trapq, so the
# toolhead trapq is still for the whole 2 s; contact_guard.test asserts
# the same sequence ends in contact, so the only command left to fail is
# the G1.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG contact_guard.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
G90
G1 X50 Y50 Z5 F6000
CONTACT_GUARD_SIMULATE LOAD=0 DURATION=0.5
FORCE_MOVE STEPPER=stepper_z DISTANCE=-1 VELOCITY=5
CONTACT_GUARD_SIMULATE LOAD=200000 DURATION=2
G1 X60 Y50 Z5
